          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148030,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Segna il codice che appartiene a queste funzioni.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"114\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"healPlayer\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player healed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"healPlayer();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>}</code> e poi <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148031,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché creiamo le funzioni?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Raggruppare e riutilizzare codice correlato</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per separare il codice correlato</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Per facilitare la creazione delle variabili</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Raggruppare e riutilizzare codice correlato.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148032,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando chiamiamo una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il codice all'interno della funzione viene eseguito</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tutto il codice all'interno della funzione è memorizzato in una variabile</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">All'interno della funzione viene creato un ciclo while</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il codice all'interno della funzione viene eseguito.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148033,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la chiamata alla funzione scrivendo il suo nome.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"115\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot; points&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score + label);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayScore();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>displayScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148034,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"startLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"startLevel();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code> su una riga e <code>Level started</code> su quella successiva</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Level started</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> su una riga e <code>Level started</code> su quella successiva.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il parametro in questa funzione?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addItemToInventory\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>item</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è alcun parametro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>item</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione e passale un valore.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"118\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeItemFromInventory\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dropped: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeItemFromInventory(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>removeItemFromInventory</code>, seguito da <code>\"Health Potion\"</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148037,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa servono i parametri?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I parametri ci aiutano a passare informazioni specifiche alle funzioni</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">I parametri rendono più facile chiamare le funzioni</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">I parametri ci permettono di visualizzare le variabili nella console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I parametri ci aiutano a passare informazioni specifiche alle funzioni.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148038,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi un parametro alla funzione e poi chiamala con un valore.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"115\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"updatePlayerHealth\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player health:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(health);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updatePlayerHealth(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>health</code>, seguito da <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la chiamata alla funzione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"94\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"amount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot; points&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(amount + label);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"addScore(\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>addScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando aggiungiamo un valore restituito a una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La funzione restituisce un valore al codice che la chiama</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La funzione non può più utilizzare istruzioni display</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Significa che potremo chiamare la funzione una sola volta</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La funzione restituisce un valore al codice che la chiama.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148041,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come finiamo per restituire <code>undefined</code> dalla nostra funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dimenticando di aggiungere l'istruzione <code>return</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non includendo alcuna istruzione di visualizzazione nel nostro codice</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Chiamando la funzione con un parametro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dimenticando di aggiungere l'istruzione <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una variabile <code>result</code> e memorizza al suo interno il risultato della chiamata alla funzione con un valore.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"81\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isBossLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = isBossLevel(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>result</code> e poi <code>isBossLevel</code>, <code>14</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Restituisci la variabile da questa funzione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getPlayerHealth\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"67\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPlayerHealth());}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayLevelUnlocked\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level unlocked: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = displayLevelUnlocked(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Level unlocked: 5</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non viene visualizzato nulla nella console</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Level unlocked: 5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
